### 1. Register New User (යාළුවෙක්ව ලියාපදිංචි කිරීම)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test User",
    "username": "testuser123",
    "password": "password123"
}

###

### 2. Login User (ලොග් වීම)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser123",
    "password": "password123"
}

### බොරු ඩිපොසිට් රික්වෙස්ට් එකක් ඩේටාබේස් එකට දැමීම
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/deposits/test-create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hichcha",
  "amount": 1000,
  "slipUrl": "https://placehold.co/400x500?text=Cybet+Test+Slip+15000"
}